; Warning policy for the whole project (inherited by subdirectories).
;
; -warn-error is deliberately *not* enabled: the C++ stubs layer and the
; dune-configurator script cannot avoid a few warnings, and promoting them to
; errors here would only get in the way of the build. Enable it in CI if you
; want the stricter gate.
(env
 (dev
  (flags
   (:standard -w +a-4-9-40-41-42-44-45-48-70 -warn-error -a))))